## DIAGNOSE (map feedback to fix)

| Feedback | Root Cause | Fix |
|----------|-----------|-----|
| "Background too flat" | Pure white, no dimension | Add gradient (white -> light gray) + ground shadow |
| "[product] looks dull" | Lighting too flat, speculars over-controlled | 3:1 ratio, let speculars breathe |

## TARGETED FIX

Only adjust what feedback addressed:
- Background: Gradient + subtle shadow
- Lighting: 3:1 ratio
- Enhancement: Boost contrast, sharpen

-> [image_studio with targeted fixes only]
-> [view_image on output] Re-verify

**Re-critique:** All 9+, feedback addressed. Ship.
</reasoning>

